WEBVTT

00:10:26.954 --> 00:10:31.871
or what it means to be a chaplain or
a critic of the tech industry.

00:10:32.329 --> 00:10:37.246
There really is a desperate
call for support

00:10:37.246 --> 00:10:41.496
for people who are trying to figure out
how to live meaningfully in this time.

00:10:42.162 --> 00:10:48.454
I find myself having these conversations
in my head every single day about what

00:10:48.454 --> 00:10:51.079
does it mean to cope with
a pandemic like this?

00:10:51.537 --> 00:10:55.871
Is our life ever going to be the same? Is
this the fall of the American empire?

00:10:56.496 --> 00:10:59.037
Should I radically reinvasion
my own future?

00:10:59.329 --> 00:11:01.996
Should I radically reinvasion
my child's future?